    "0:06 - Subject returns razor to chin/jaw; reflection shows razor at mirrored chin position, matching arm angle and head posture at the same instant.",
    "0:08 - Subject holds razor at his right cheek near the sideburn; reflection shows razor at the mirrored cheek (viewer-left of reflected face), arm and head positions matching."
